WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.827
Here's how Groundwork starts, from a brand-new install. Every figure in this tour is made up.

2
00:00:07.077 --> 00:00:13.840
First it checks what your computer can run. The AI works only on your computer, and every page works with it off.

3
00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:22.477
Then choose how to begin: look around a sample household, bring in your bank's history, set things up by hand, or restore a backup.

4
00:00:23.327 --> 00:00:27.124
Start with what comes in: your take-home pay, and how often you're paid.

5
00:00:27.974 --> 00:00:33.094
A few questions about your home. Each one can be skipped, and nothing is assumed in its place.

6
00:00:33.944 --> 00:00:39.939
Then your regular bills. Ballpark figures are fine, and you can fine-tune them later on the Budget page.

7
00:00:40.789 --> 00:00:47.914
Every card and loan, once: its balance, rate and minimum. It also shows what paying only the minimums would cost.

8
00:00:48.764 --> 00:00:53.351
What would you like spare money to do? There's no wrong answer, and nothing here is locked in.

9
00:00:54.201 --> 00:00:59.172
A net worth target is optional. It gives the plan a destination, if you'd like one.

10
00:01:00.022 --> 00:01:06.102
And here's where you stand: the room in your month, your debts, and anything you skipped, so you know what's still unanswered.

11
00:01:06.952 --> 00:01:13.288
From there, it's your Groundwork. Bring in a statement, or let Get my accounts fetch one, and every page fills in.

12
00:01:14.388 --> 00:01:19.444
No account, no subscription, and nothing to sell you. Groundwork 2.0 is free.
